{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12110150","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12110150","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1211015001:1":{"text":"I'm exhausted... We finally caught three different kinds of fish.","source_cn":"累死了……费了这么大劲，总算钓齐了三种鱼！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC57FE72D7EC1345","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1211015002:1":{"text":"It's already dark. Let's keep them in a little pond for now.","source_cn":"天都黑了，先放在水洼里养着吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D1A3A4D95CBCDC0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1211015003:1":{"text":"Where should we bring them after this?","source_cn":"接下来，我们要把这些鱼送去哪里？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF8B4A39B13FE6AAA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1211015004:1":{"text":"The gruglin said to give them to a princess. We can look around in the morning.","source_cn":"那个智慧过人的咕布林说要送给公主，等天亮了再去找找吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E3C4831F6D7278D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1211015005:1":{"text":"Oh, I've heard a story of a princess! A brave knight found her and woke her up from her dream.","source_cn":"我听过公主的故事！勇敢的骑士找到了公主，把她从梦境里唤醒！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEEE720D262F76681","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1211015006:1":{"text":"Then the princess picked up a sword and defeated the dragon.","source_cn":"然后——公主拿起刀，把恶龙打倒了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A769C4443BC2907","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1211015007:1":{"text":"What kind of fairy tale is this? I've never heard of it...","source_cn":"咦，这是什么童话故事？没听说过……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE09C8B9C987E08D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1211015008:1":{"text":"It's a bedtime story that Sonja used to tell me.","source_cn":"是索尼娅姐姐给我讲的睡前故事！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E68843D3E8F2EA9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1211015009:1":{"text":"... I just made it up.","source_cn":"咳……我随口编的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8963F7BCC9B81F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1211015010:1":{"text":"I love listening to Sonja's stories! Whether it's the fairy eating the shark or the story of the lumberjack overthrowing a gang, I love them all!","source_cn":"我很喜欢听索尼娅姐姐讲故事！无论是草仙子吃掉鲨鱼……还...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80DB2605241A5231","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1211015011:1":{"text":"Sonja, what types of stories did you tell your sister...? It seems there's more to you than meets the eye.","source_cn":"索尼娅，你给你妹妹讲的都是些什么故事啊……嘿，你比我想...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B2A4B833DCF598B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1211015012:1":{"text":"That was a long time ago... when I first joined the Carmine Whispers. Apparently, she remembers more than I do.","source_cn":"那都是加入血薇帮很久以前的事了，我都记不清，她居然还记得。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x86EE338CE30402F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1211015013:1":{"text":"We have more important things to talk about... If we were to spend the night here, we're going to need a fire.","source_cn":"不说这些了，如果要在这里过夜，我们得先把篝火燃起来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA358CD7B233FA297","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1211015014:1":{"text":"I'll help.","source_cn":"我来帮忙。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE1EFD0CA0A695EA1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1211015015:1":{"text":"Chippy will help too!","source_cn":"我也来帮忙！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D8B3E3F70D9C64E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:辛巴达":{"text":"Sinbad","source":"辛巴达","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"Chippy","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:奈拉":{"text":"Nara","source":"奈拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"Hammie","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:索尼娅":{"text":"Sonja","source":"索尼娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":16,"localized_text_count":15,"speaker_count":5}}